{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Wonders from Your Torah</b> — It is not attached, except [by] ואביטה (\"and I will gaze\"), as in: ולא כחדו מאבותם (\"and they did not hide [it] from their fathers\"). And so it [reads]: גל עיני ואביטה מתורתך נפלאות ממני (\"Open my eyes and I will gaze / wonders from Your Torah / [wonders] from me\")."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:15.000940935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}